From f79b0bf7114453f8f54deafbd4f7f5680161434e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erik Faye-Lund <erik.faye-lund@arm.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 10:07:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] nir: use dst_access for the store

We use the src_access for the load, but we should've been using
dst_access for the store. This looks like a simple typo.

Fixes: 6f20643b471 ("nir: Allow qualifiers on copy_deref and image instructions")
Reviewed-by: Connor Abbott <cwabbott0@gmail.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45539>
(cherry picked from commit 1991790a9cf935c5c414d5cac3d60b053c7678c6)
Link: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/commit/f79b0bf7114453f8f54deafbd4f7f5680161434e
[ adapted: dropped .pick_status.json, not in the 26.3.0 tarball or bookkeeping only ]
---
 .pick_status.json                       | 2 +-
 src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_var_copies.c | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_var_copies.c b/src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_var_copies.c
index 6c5ddc3b0131..3e08e4d3a46d 100644
--- a/src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_var_copies.c
+++ b/src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_var_copies.c
@@ -86,7 +86,7 @@ emit_deref_copy_load_store(nir_builder *b,
 
       nir_store_deref_with_access(b, dst_deref,
                                   nir_load_deref_with_access(b, src_deref, src_access),
-                                  ~0, src_access);
+                                  ~0, dst_access);
    }
 }
 
